# Current-scope entry

The authoritative entry for the current scope is the `AGENTS.md` at the project or line scope root.
This file lives under `.cursor/rules/`; it still points to that parent scope root and never to a sibling `AGENTS.md` beside this pointer.
Read the current scope's root `AGENTS.md` before working; this file does not duplicate its rules.
